 fitness monitoring. Shot Scope V5 stands out for shot analysis, including 16 free club tags, though tracking must be activated manually. Buyers should consider price, course availability, desired smartwatch functions and battery life. Testing involves repeated rounds on real courses, assessing GPS, shot tracking, battery, phone compatibility and overall performance.","ref_id":{"turn_index":100051,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":13},"pub_date":1793121955.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/F9PztLkaXYwT0z1vBZvLnZEwtETVssvxNyMI4ot2Hd4MEghXxitxpNVUKycDVzIrNlpyWKQK75_EmwOKTu-aWh5tAdlDGif9YiZ-Rq1OvDAdInrutNb7wUpWltwEOHjk","attribution":"www.techradar.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"t5golf.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://t5golf.com/best-gps-golf-watches-under-300/","title":"Best GPS Golf Watches Under $300 (2026): Top Picks for Every Handicap \u2013 T5 Golf","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":100051,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":7},"pub_date":1773964800.0,"attribution":"t5golf.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.smartfitgolf.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.smartfitgolf.com/reviews/best-golf-gps-watches-2026","title":"Top 10 Golf GPS Watches for 2026 \u2014 SmartFit Golf","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":100051,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":8},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"www.smartfitgolf.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"gamecaddie.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://gamecaddie.com/blog/best-golf-gps-watch/","title":"Best golf GPS watch: what you pay after year one | GameCaddie","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":100051,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":9},"pub_date":null,"attribution":"gamecaddie.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"mygolfspy.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://mygolfspy.com/buyers-guides/golf-gps-units/best-golf-gps-devices-of-2026/","title":"Best Golf GPS Devices Of 2026 | MyGolfSp